<title>ITALY: SOCCER-JUVENTUS V ROSENBORG TEAMS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-JUVENTUS V ROSENBORG TEAMS.</headline>
<dateline>TURIN, Italy 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Teams for the European Cup quarter-final second leg match between Juventus of Italy and Rosenborg of Norway on Wednesday:</p>
<p>Juventus - 1-Angelo Peruzzi; 5-Sergio Porrini, 2-Ciro Ferrara, 4-Paolo Montero, 13-Mark Juliano, 7-Angelo Di Livio, 21-Ziredine Zidane, 14-Didier Deschamps, 18-Vladimir Jugovic, 16-Nicola Amoruso, 15-Christian Vieri.</p>
<p>Rosenborg - 1-Joern Jamtfall; 27-Andre Bergdoelmo, 15-Jon Olav Hjelde, 3-Erik Hoftun, 5-Stale Stensaas, 6-Roar Strand, 8-Bent Skammelsrud, 20-Trond Egil Soltvedt, 14-Vegard Heggem, 26-Sigurd Rushfeldt, 11-Mini Jakobsen.</p>
</text>
